emediated builds.\n5. The module inventory entries for all remediated Platform Operator images reflect the post-remediation state.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): Platform Operator images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using validated crypto modules.\n- HLR-3 (P1, bundled): the CI FIPS regression check covering Platform Operator builds is authored and verified here — it spans the same build surfaces and remediated images as the HLR-1 work, so it is not separately schedulable as its own epic.\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- The Platform Operator's owning team and midstream repo are not identified in the strategy or the provisioned architecture context; team assignment (RHOAI Platform) is an assumption recorded in the decomposition health warnings and should be confirmed at planning.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63118,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-846eb023bd761b18","agent_id":"a752c525d87d20bde","session_id":"b04d48ec-e92b-4b9b-98a0-90c74f405f25","uuid":"ae44128b-1de6-4521-8740-535c27336328","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:03:13.032Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
